            "review_text": "chriso1966\nLondon, United Kingdom276 contributions\n0\nGreat staff average breakfast good smoothie\nJul 2023 • Solo\nThis place is situated at the top of the rd. Unfortunately it gets a lot of street vendors who won't take no for an answer it kinda ruins it the staff should not let them come in side and bother people. But they let it happen. I found myself going there most mornings for breakfast eggs etc seems like the food comes from next door restaurant maybe same owner .. all in all fairly good coffee is generally not that hot and weak in a small cup good selection of smoothies . Also have a selection of baguettes which I never tried handy place for where my hotel was situated\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 18, 2023",
